#: ../../library/math.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`math` --- mathematical functions"
msgstr ":mod:`math` --- fungsi matematika"

#: ../../library/math.rst:7
msgid ""
"The ``math`` module provides some basic mathematical functions for working "
"with floating-point numbers."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``math`` menyediakan beberapa fungsi matematika dasar untuk bekerja "
"dengan bilangan floating-point."

#: ../../library/math.rst:10
msgid ""
"*Note:* On the OpenMV Cam, floating-point numbers have 32-bit precision."
msgstr ""
"*Catatan:* Pada OpenMV Cam, bilangan floating-point memiliki presisi 32-bit."

#: ../../library/math.rst:13
msgid "Functions"
msgstr "Fungsi"

#: ../../library/math.rst:17
msgid "Return the inverse cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan arccos dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:21
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan arccos hiperbolik dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:25
msgid "Return the inverse sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan arcsin dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:29
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan arcsin hiperbolik dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:33
msgid "Return the inverse tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan arctan dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:37
msgid "Return the principal value of the inverse tangent of ``y/x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan nilai utama arctan dari ``y/x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:41
msgid "Return the inverse hyperbolic tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan arctan hiperbolik dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:45
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards positive infinity."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan bilangan bulat, yaitu ``x`` dibulatkan ke arah positif tak "
"hingga."

#: ../../library/math.rst:49
msgid "Return ``x`` with the sign of ``y``."
msgstr "Kembalikan ``x`` dengan tanda dari ``y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:53
msgid "Return the cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan kosinus dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:57
msgid "Return the hyperbolic cosine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan kosinus hiperbolik dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:61
msgid "Return radians ``x`` converted to degrees."
msgstr "Kembalikan radian ``x`` yang dikonversi ke derajat."

#: ../../library/math.rst:65
msgid "Return the error function of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan fungsi galat dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:69
msgid "Return the complementary error function of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan fungsi galat komplementer dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:73
msgid "Return the exponential of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan eksponen dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:77
msgid "Return ``exp(x) - 1``."
msgstr "Kembalikan ``exp(x) - 1``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:81
msgid "Return the absolute value of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan nilai absolut dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:85
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards negative infinity."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan bilangan bulat, yaitu ``x`` dibulatkan ke arah negatif tak "
"hingga."

#: ../../library/math.rst:89
msgid "Return the remainder of ``x/y``."
msgstr "Kembalikan sisa bagi dari ``x/y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:93
msgid ""
"Decomposes a floating-point number into its mantissa and exponent. The "
"returned value is the tuple ``(m, e)`` such that ``x == m * 2**e`` exactly."
"  If ``x == 0`` then the function returns ``(0.0, 0)``, otherwise the "
"relation ``0.5 <= abs(m) < 1`` holds."
msgstr ""
"Menguraikan bilangan floating-point menjadi mantissa dan eksponennya. Nilai "
"yang dikembalikan adalah tuple ``(m, e)`` sedemikian sehingga ``x == m * "
"2**e`` secara tepat. Jika ``x == 0`` maka fungsi mengembalikan ``(0.0, "
"0)``\\ , jika tidak, relasi ``0.5 <= abs(m) < 1`` berlaku."

#: ../../library/math.rst:100
msgid "Return the gamma function of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan fungsi gamma dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:104
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is finite."
msgstr "Kembalikan ``True`` jika ``x`` adalah bilangan hingga."

#: ../../library/math.rst:108
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is infinite."
msgstr "Kembalikan ``True`` jika ``x`` adalah tak hingga."

#: ../../library/math.rst:112
msgid "Return ``True`` if ``x`` is not-a-number"
msgstr "Kembalikan ``True`` jika ``x`` adalah bukan-angka"

#: ../../library/math.rst:116
msgid "Return ``x * (2**exp)``."
msgstr "Kembalikan ``x * (2**exp)``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:120
msgid "Return the natural logarithm of the gamma function of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan logaritma natural dari fungsi gamma dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:124
msgid "With one argument, return the natural logarithm of *x*."
msgstr "Dengan satu argumen, kembalikan logaritma natural dari *x*\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:126
msgid "With two arguments, return the logarithm of *x* to the given *base*."
msgstr ""
"Dengan dua argumen, kembalikan logaritma dari *x* dengan *base* yang "
"diberikan."

#: ../../library/math.rst:130
msgid "Return the base-10 logarithm of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan logaritma basis-10 dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:134
msgid "Return the base-2 logarithm of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan logaritma basis-2 dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:138
msgid ""
"Return a tuple of two floats, being the fractional and integral parts of "
"``x``.  Both return values have the same sign as ``x``."
msgstr ""
"Kembalikan tuple dua float, yaitu bagian pecahan dan bagian integral dari "
"``x``\\ . Kedua nilai kembalian memiliki tanda yang sama dengan ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:143
msgid "Returns ``x`` to the power of ``y``."
msgstr "Kembalikan ``x`` pangkat ``y``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:147
msgid "Return degrees ``x`` converted to radians."
msgstr "Kembalikan derajat ``x`` yang dikonversi ke radian."

#: ../../library/math.rst:151
msgid "Return the sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan sinus dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:155
msgid "Return the hyperbolic sine of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan sinus hiperbolik dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:159
msgid "Return the square root of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan akar kuadrat dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:163
msgid "Return the tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan tangen dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:167
msgid "Return the hyperbolic tangent of ``x``."
msgstr "Kembalikan tangen hiperbolik dari ``x``\\ ."

#: ../../library/math.rst:171
msgid "Return an integer, being ``x`` rounded towards 0."
msgstr "Kembalikan bilangan bulat, yaitu ``x`` dibulatkan ke arah 0."

